  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4105.03 Products registered under FIFRA",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4105.03 Products registered under FIFRA. For any consumer product that is registered under FIFRA, the VOC standards specified in table 4105-1 shall apply one year after the specified date.\n\nSource. #8439, eff 9-24-05; ss by #10527, eff 2-26-14 (from Env-A 4103.03); ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24",
